ttps://i.ytimg.com/vi/YVygwpmcKl0/sddefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEmCIAFEOAD8quKqQMa8AEB-AG2CIACuAiKAgwIABABGGUgXyhVMA8=&rs=AOn4CLAOOuK9sGx6Wt-IoJQLjPnk7vdbVg", "description": "\"#buytopuphealthinsurance #besttopuphealthinsuranceplan #icicigrouphealthinsurancetopupplan #healthinsurance #healthinsuranceplan\n\nYou can support your existing health insurance plan with ICICI Lombard Group Health Top-up Plan. To get high sum insured up to ₹ 50 Lakh with Premium Starting at ₹ 7 per day. Watch this video to know on, how to avail  group health top up insurance, premium amount, sum assured, family member addition and more with iMobile Pay App.\n\nDownload iMobile Pay App:\nhttps://www.icicibank.com/mobile-banking/imobile-pay.page\n\nSteps to avail Group Health Top Up Plan through iMobile Pay app.\n- Login to iMobile Pay app.\n- Tap on “Health/Travel Cover” under Invest and Insure.\n- Select “Group Health Top Up”.\n- And click on “Buy Now”.\n- Fill in your personal details.\n- And select the Sum Insured.\n- Fill in the details of additional family members you would like to insure.\n- Select a preferred deductible value among 3 Lakh, 4 Lakh and 5 Lakh.\n- Choose the mode of payment.\n- Tap on “Proceed”.\n- Fill in the nominee details and proceed to payment.\n- Verify your details before tapping on “Proceed”.\n- Congratulations! You have booked your Group Health Top up Policy.\n\nTo know more about ICICI Bank Health Top Up Cover:\nhttps://www.icicibank.com/Personal-Banking/insurance/health-insurance/health-booster.page\n\nSubscribe to the ICICI Bank YouTube Channel and remember to press the bell icon to get notifications on our latest products and services offerings. \nhttps://www.youtube.com/user/icicibank/videos?sub_confirmation=1\n\nThere is more than one way to connect with us, so be sure to check our ICICI Bank at:\nWebsite: https://www.icicibank.com\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/icicibank\nLinkedIn: https://in.linkedin.com/company/icici-bank\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/ic